ost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist <b>nicht</b> Lukas, das ist Jonas.</div>이름은 kein이 아니라 nicht로 부정해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"45619ba42b\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Meine Wohnung ist nicht hell&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">내 집은 밝지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wohnung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">hell</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Meine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ist</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meine Wohnung ist nicht hell.</b></div>sein 뒤의 형용사를 부정할 때 nicht는 형용사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"ddb4eae0d6\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Arbeitest du heute nicht? — (네, 안 해요) <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, ich bleibe zu Hause.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Ja</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Nein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Doch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Kein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">독일어 Ja/Nein은 문장의 내용에 맞춰요. 일하지 않는 게 맞으니까 Nein이에요.<br>한국어 말버릇에 끌려 Ja를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"73c178d193\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Herr Lee arbeitet heute nicht im Büro&quot;,&quot;Heute arbeitet Herr Lee nicht im Büro&quot;,&quot;Im Büro arbeitet Herr Lee heute nicht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 씨는 오늘 사무실에서 일하지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Büro</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Lee</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Herr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">arbeitet</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Herr Lee arbeitet heute nicht im Büro.</b></div>시간 표현 heute는 nicht보다 앞, 장소 표현 im Büro는 nicht 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4c4b60f35a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meinen&quot;],[&quot;nicht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Ich finde <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich의 소유관사 · Schlüssel 남성 단수)</span> Schlüssel <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">내 열쇠를 못 찾겠어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich finde <b>meinen</b> Schlüssel <b>nicht</b>.</div>소유관사가 붙은 명사는 kein이 아니라 nicht로 부정해요.<br>문장 전체 부정이라 nicht는 목적어 뒤, 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1a1903f9f4\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> '우리는 더는 쾰른에 살지 않아요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Wir wohnen nicht in Köln mehr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Wir wohnen nicht mehr in Köln.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Wir wohnen kein mehr in Köln.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Wir wohnen noch nicht in Köln.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'더는 ~ 않다'는 nicht mehr예요. noch nicht는 '아직 ~ 않다'예요.<br>nicht mehr는 장소 표현 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0cd1feed23\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;keine&quot;],[&quot;sondern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Das ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Tasse · 여성)</span> Tasse, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> ein Glas.</div><div class=\"qko\">이건 컵이 아니라 유리잔이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist <b>keine</b> Tasse, <b>sondern</b> ein Glas.</div>eine Tasse처럼 ein이 붙는 명사를 부정하니까 kein이에요. 여성 1격이라 keine예요.<br>앞의 부정을 바로잡을 때는 sondern이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8eb8de7aad\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;noch&quot;],[&quot;nicht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Paula ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> da.</div><div class=\"qko\">파울라는 아직 안 왔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Paula ist <b>noch</b> <b>nicht</b> da.</div>'아직 ~ 않다'는 noch nicht예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d3034e451e\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Ich habe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Bruder und <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Schwester. (남자 형제도 여자 형제도 없어요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) keinen … keinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) nicht … nicht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) keinen … keine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) kein … keine</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사를 부정하니까 kein이에요. 끝은 명사마다 따로 정해요.<br>Bruder는 남성 4격 keinen, Schwester는 여성 4격 keine예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fda4b7afd3\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir fahren nicht nach Rom sondern nach Mailand&quot;,&quot;Nicht nach Rom sondern nach Mailand fahren wir&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 로마가 아니라 밀라노로 가요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Mailand</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">fahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Rom</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sondern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">nach</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir fahren nicht nach Rom, sondern nach Mailand.</b></div>일부만 부정할 때는 그 말(nach Rom) 바로 앞에 nicht를 놓고 sondern으로 바로잡아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"14412a9baf\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Wir kennen ihn nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"3\">b) Ich trinke nicht Milch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Sie ist nicht die Chefin.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"0\">d) Ich spreche kein Japanisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">관사 없는 물질명사 Milch는 kein으로 부정해요 — Ich trinke keine Milch.<br>언어 이름은 kein, 정관사 명사와 대명사는 nicht로 부정해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"97c0b4414f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Doch&quot;],[&quot;Nein&quot;],[&quot;nicht&quot;],[&quot;keine&quot;],[&quot;Doch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> A: Ist Tom nicht zu Hause? — B: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\">, er ist im Garten.<br>A: Und Sara? Ist sie da? — B: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">, sie ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> da.<br>A: Hat Tom <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(Zeit · 여성)</span> Zeit? — B: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\">, er hat Zeit.</div><div class=\"qko\">톰은 집에 없어요? — 아니요, 정원에 있어요. / 그럼 사라는요? 사라는 있어요? — 아니요, 사라는 없어요. / 톰은 시간이 없어요? — 아니요, 시간 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · A: Ist Tom nicht zu Hause? — B: <b>Doch</b>, er ist im Garten.<br>A: Und Sara? Ist sie da? — B: <b>Nein</b>, sie ist <b>nicht</b> da.<br>A: Hat Tom <b>keine</b> Zeit? — B: <b>Doch</b>, er hat Zeit.</div>부정 질문을 뒤집어 '있다'고 답할 때는 Doch예요.<br>긍정 질문에 '없다'고 답하면 Nein이고, 이어서 nicht로 부정해요. 관사 없는 Zeit를 부정하면 keine예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ea09ea9194\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich leihe es ihm heute nicht&quot;,&quot;Heute leihe ich es ihm nicht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 그것을 그에게 빌려주지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">leihe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ihm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Ich</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich leihe es ihm heute nicht.</b></div>대명사끼리는 4격(es) → 3격(ihm), 그다음 시간 표현이 와요.<br>문장 전체 부정의 nicht는 그 뒤, 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1bf66c4657\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kein&quot;],[&quot;mehr&quot;],[&quot;Niemand&quot;],[&quot;nichts&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Ich habe noch Brot. → Ich habe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Brot <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.<br>Jemand ist da. → <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> ist da.<br>Sie isst etwas. → Sie isst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 빵이 더는 없어요. / 아무도 없어요. / 그녀는 아무것도 안 먹어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe noch Brot. → Ich habe <b>kein</b> Brot <b>mehr</b>.<br>Jemand ist da. → <b>Niemand</b> ist da.<br>Sie isst etwas. → Sie isst <b>nichts</b>.</div>noch + 명사의 반대는 kein … mehr예요.<br>jemand의 반대는 niemand, etwas의 반대는 nichts이고, nicht를 더 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"701f4008ab\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> '나는 프랑스어를 잘하지는 못해요.' (조금은 해요)</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Ich spreche kein Französisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Ich spreche nicht gut Französisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Ich spreche gut Französisch nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Ich spreche kein gut Französisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">부사 gut을 부정하니까 nicht를 gut 바로 앞에 놓아요.<br>kein Französisch는 '프랑스어를 전혀 못한다'는 뜻이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1aec79a4bf\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> '나는 내일이 아니라 오늘 우리 할머니를 찾아뵈어요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Ich besuche meine Oma morgen nicht, aber heute.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Ich besuche nicht meine Oma morgen, sondern heute.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Ich besuche meine Oma nicht morgen, sondern heute.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Ich besuche keine Oma morgen, sondern heute.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">morgen만 부정하니까 nicht를 morgen 바로 앞에 놓고 sondern으로 바로잡아요.<br>소유관사가 붙은 meine Oma는 kein으로 부정하지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"d5b7692d34\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe keinen Regenschirm.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> kein으로 부정하는 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich habe einen Regenschirm.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe keinen Regenschirm.</b></div>부정관사가 붙은 명사는 kein으로 부정해요. 남성 4격 → keinen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"433d063b1a\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Laden ist heute nicht offen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> nicht로 부정하는 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Der Laden ist heute offen.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 32\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Laden ist heute nicht offen.</b></div>형용사를 부정할 때 nicht는 형용사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"36bc037b35\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir kaufen das Auto nicht.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> nicht로 부정하는 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir kaufen das Auto.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir kaufen das Auto nicht.</b></div>정관사가 붙은 명사는 kein이 아니라 nicht로 부정해요. 문장 전체를 부정하는 nicht는 끝으로 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"01e4874d71\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 오늘 돈이 없어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">haben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Geld.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Wir haben heute kein Geld.</b></div>관사 없는 명사는 kein으로 부정해요. Geld는 중성이라 kein이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"638aedbbd1\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"2\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 남자 형제가 없어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">keine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Bruder.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Sie hat keinen Bruder.</b></div>Bruder는 남성 4격이라 keinen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9d48897e9f\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"6\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">차 안 좋아해? – 아니, 아주 좋아해.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Trinkst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">gern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Tee?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">–</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">Ja,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">sehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">gern.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Trinkst du nicht gern Tee? – Doch, sehr gern.</b></div>부정 의문문에 긍정으로 대답할 때는 Doch예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"